PublisherContentFrame
1 byte frame type -> Auth, AuthAck, PubContent, PubAck, SubContent, SubAck
16 bytes -> messageId; uuid
8 bytes -> created at; long
2 bytes -> topic length; short
10-200 bytes ->  topicId; utf-8 string
1 byte -> channelId;
4 bytes -> ttl; int
4 bytes -> payload length; int
N bytes -> payload
1 byte -> end of frame marker

